WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.402
-President Trump
has spent the week

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:05.271
defending himself from
accusations of Russian collusion

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.306
and defending
his Supreme Court nominee

00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:08.941
from accusations
of sexual assault.

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:11.044
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:16.082
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.484
During the campaign,
Trump borrowed from years

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.653
of GOP rhetoric
and referred to himself

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.088
as the "law and order"
candidate.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.889
Trump used the phrase
"law and order"

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:26.025
more often than my cable guide.

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:27.460
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.630
He insisted that the law should
apply equally to everyone,

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.332
and by "everyone,"
he meant immigrants,

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.501
people of color,
and Hillary Clinton.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:39.272
-What makes us exceptional
is that we are a nation of laws

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:43.509
and that we are all equal
under those laws.

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:46.446
Hillary's corruption
shreds the principle

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:49.649
of which our nation was founded.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.417
We either have a country
or we don't.

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:52.485
We're a country of laws.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.320
We either have a border
or we don't.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.722
-"We either have a border
or we don't."

00:00:56.722 --> 00:00:59.058
Trump's brain
is only capable of lies

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:01.294
and super, super obvious truths.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.295
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:04.230
After all,
this is the same brain

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.266
that just the other day
called Hurricane Florence

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:08.500
"one of the wettest
we've ever seen

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.270
from the standpoint of water."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.305
Oh!

00:01:13.305 --> 00:01:16.942
Oh, from
the standpoint of water.

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:18.411
I'm so glad you clarified.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:19.679
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.614
Trump's like a college freshman
trying to write

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:24.684
a five-page essay for a class
he never attended.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:28.421
"In this essay, I will show that
water has a high wetness level,

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.857
and that the general
wetness of water, which is,

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:32.358
as it relates to being water,

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:34.727
very wet
from a water standpoint."

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:37.830
"Donald, the margins
on this paper are 3 1/2 inches."

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.199
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:42.068
There you go.
There you go.

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.369
You heard Trump.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:46.039
You heard him.
We are a country of laws.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.707
Like, for example,
election laws.

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:50.209
And yet Trump
has spent the week insisting

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:51.744
that the Russia probe
is illegitimate.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.380
He took the unprecedented step
of declassifying documents

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.783
from the investigation
in an attempt to undermine it,

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.551
and in an interview
with "The Hill,"

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:01.020
he even blamed Attorney General
Jeff Sessions, saying,

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.288
"I don't have
an Attorney General.

00:02:03.288 --> 00:02:04.790
It's very sad."

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:07.360
Oh, my God.
He's like a wounded mother

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.963
who just found weed
in her son's sock drawer.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.330
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:12.898
"Get out of my house!"

00:02:12.898 --> 00:02:14.566
"But I'm your son!"

00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:16.402
"I don't have a son."

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:20.506
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:23.075
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.075 --> 00:02:26.846
And yet --
And yet while Trump undermines

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.915
the Russia investigation,
he also wants to make it

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:30.617
seem like
he's been tough on Russia,

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:32.518
as he did during
a press conference on Tuesday

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:33.686
where he claimed he was

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.188
countering Russian aggression
with force.

00:02:36.188 --> 00:02:39.458
-I think that Russia
has acted aggressively.

00:02:39.458 --> 00:02:40.826
They respect force.

00:02:40.826 --> 00:02:43.429
They respect strength,
as anyone does.

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:46.331
And we have the greatest
strength in the world.

00:02:46.331 --> 00:02:47.666
Especially now.

00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:50.703
We were being depleted
under the last administration.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:52.672
We had planes
that were old and tired

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:55.708
and didn't fly in some cases.

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.243
[ Laughter ]
-That's right.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:03:00.446
The planes wouldn't fly
because they were tired.

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:01.747
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:04.149
It's official --
Trump thinks in cartoons.

00:03:04.149 --> 00:03:08.054
In his mind, the planes fly by
literally flapping their wings,

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:10.489
and they have faces
like Thomas the Tank Engine.

00:03:10.489 --> 00:03:12.959
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:15.828
Hey, fella.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:18.464
And yet every day, the Russia
probe gets worse for Trump.

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:20.966
Last week, his ex-campaign
chairman Paul Manafort

00:03:20.966 --> 00:03:22.768
flipped on him,
and late today we found out

00:03:22.768 --> 00:03:25.438
that his long-time personal
lawyer and fixer, Michael Cohen,

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:27.173
met with investigators, too.

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:29.575
-President Trump's former
personal attorney Michael Cohen

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:31.744
has been interviewed
multiple times

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:33.846
by Special Counsel
Robert Mueller's team

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:36.516
over the past few weeks,
according to ABC News.

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:38.584
The interviews
have lasted for hours

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:41.654
and been focused
on Trump's dealings with Russia

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:43.789
and any possible conspiracy

00:03:43.789 --> 00:03:46.359
between the Trump campaign
and Moscow.

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:48.761
-Damn, I'm not saying
Trump is scared right now,

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:49.962
but when he heard that,

00:03:49.962 --> 00:03:51.930
his pants were
the wettest we've ever seen...

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.967
[ Laughter ]
...from the standpoint of water.

00:03:54.967 --> 00:03:58.805
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:02.508
So, again, this is a man
who said we're a nation of laws.

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:04.577
If he's not concerned
with breaking election law,

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:06.378
then how about laws
against sexual assault?

00:04:06.378 --> 00:04:07.680
What did Trump have to say

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.415
when he was asked about
the allegations

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:11.517
against his Supreme Court
nominee Brett Kavanaugh?

00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:12.785
Probably something like,

00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:15.154
"We're a nation of laws,
and justice must be served."

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:18.324
Let me lean on my fists
and watch.

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:20.459
-I feel so badly for him
that he's going through this,

00:04:20.459 --> 00:04:21.460
to be honest with you.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.362
I feel so badly for him.

00:04:23.362 --> 00:04:25.497
This is not a man
that deserves this.

00:04:25.497 --> 00:04:28.167
Really, they're hurting
somebody's life very badly.

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:31.304
And it's very unfair,
I think, to --

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:35.341
As you know, Justice Kavanaugh's
been treated very, very tough.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.578
And his family, I think,
it's a very unfair thing

00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:39.645
what's going on.

00:04:39.645 --> 00:04:41.780
He is such an outstanding man.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.884
Very hard for me to imagine
that anything happened.

00:04:46.752 --> 00:04:52.557
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]
-Now...

00:04:52.557 --> 00:04:54.560
Now, Trump has said --

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.862
Trump has said he wants to hear

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:58.664
from Kavanaugh's accuser,
Dr. Christine Blasey Ford.

00:04:58.664 --> 00:05:00.733
But he also said Democrats
were only coming forward

00:05:00.733 --> 00:05:02.869
with these allegations now
for political reasons.

00:05:12.411 --> 00:05:14.213
They make a lot of stuff?

00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:16.415
If I started listing
all the stuff you've made up,

00:05:16.415 --> 00:05:19.085
I'd still be here tomorrow
during "Days of Our Lives."

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:20.686
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.686 --> 00:05:23.055
Trump and Senate Republicans
are trying to sound like

00:05:23.055 --> 00:05:24.490
they're being fair-minded,
but in reality,

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.658
it's clear they have no interest

00:05:25.658 --> 00:05:26.892
in getting to the bottom
of what happened.

00:05:26.892 --> 00:05:29.194
One way they could do that
is by asking the FBI

00:05:29.194 --> 00:05:31.097
to reopen their
background check on Kavanaugh,

00:05:31.097 --> 00:05:32.799
something the FBI
does all the time.

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:34.367
But Trump has tried
to make it sound like

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:36.369
the FBI
doesn't want to get involved.

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:39.172
-What would be the problem
with the FBI

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.807
reopening
their background investigation

00:05:41.807 --> 00:05:43.208
into Judge Kavanaugh?

00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:45.477
Would you support such a thing?

00:05:45.477 --> 00:05:48.381
-It wouldn't bother me,
other than the FBI, John,

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:50.249
said that they
really don't do that.

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:51.784
That's not what they do.

00:05:54.753 --> 00:05:56.655
-I don't think the FBI
really should be involved

00:05:56.655 --> 00:05:58.190
because they don't want
to be involved.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.726
If they wanted to be,
I would certainly do that.

00:06:00.726 --> 00:06:03.695
But as you know, they say
this is not really their thing.

00:06:03.695 --> 00:06:05.397
-It's not their thing?

00:06:05.397 --> 00:06:08.368
They're the
Federal Bureau of investigation.

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:11.103
"Investigation"
is in the damn name.

00:06:11.103 --> 00:06:13.606
That's like saying
you don't think Taco Bell

00:06:13.606 --> 00:06:16.508
is interested in making tacos.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:16.508 --> 00:06:18.444
Well, this will shock you --
it turns out Trump is lying.

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:20.079
Bloomberg News
reported Wednesday that...

00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:34.894
Of course they can!
And Trump knows that.

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:36.595
He wakes up
at 5:00 a.m. every morning

00:06:36.595 --> 00:06:39.031
and scream tweets in all caps
about how the FBI

00:06:39.031 --> 00:06:40.432
should be investigating
"Crooked Hillary"

00:06:40.432 --> 00:06:43.436
or the "Dirty Dossier"
or why Rudy Giuliani's eyes

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:45.137
are always
trying to jump out of his head.

00:06:45.137 --> 00:06:47.373
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.373 --> 00:06:48.941
Republicans
clearly have no desire

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:50.442
to get to the bottom
of what happened.

00:06:50.442 --> 00:06:53.212
All they care about is getting
a man accused of sexual assault

00:06:53.212 --> 00:06:55.447
on the Supreme Court so
he can implement their agenda.

00:06:55.447 --> 00:06:56.782
If you have
any doubt about that,

00:06:56.782 --> 00:06:59.851
watch this exchange with
Louisiana Senator John Kennedy.

00:06:59.851 --> 00:07:02.888
A CNN anchor tries
to explain to Kennedy calmly

00:07:02.888 --> 00:07:05.791
the details of Ford's story,
but Kennedy won't have it.

00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:10.763
-You've got to have
some evidence, some facts.

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:13.366
-Okay. So, here's what we do --
here's what we do have.

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:14.567
-But, can I just --
-Because --

00:07:14.567 --> 00:07:16.168
-Poppy, let me finish.
-I heard your three --

00:07:16.168 --> 00:07:17.870
I heard your three points,
and the third one is --

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.439
-Poppy, you're better than this.
Let me finish my answer.

00:07:20.439 --> 00:07:21.607
Let me finish my answer.
You're better than this.

00:07:21.607 --> 00:07:23.476
-Your third point is salient,
and you said

00:07:23.476 --> 00:07:24.610
there have to be some facts,

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:27.012
and I just want
to note for our viewers

00:07:27.012 --> 00:07:29.414
the facts that
"The Washington Post" reported,

00:07:29.414 --> 00:07:30.682
which includes...
-Okay, let me -- let me --

00:07:30.682 --> 00:07:32.451
-...therapist's notes
from 2012...

00:07:32.451 --> 00:07:33.452
-Right.

00:07:33.452 --> 00:07:35.854
-...which include
a polygraph test.

00:07:35.854 --> 00:07:38.491
Yes?

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:40.526
-Can I talk now?

00:07:40.526 --> 00:07:44.563
-Yes.
-Oh, okay.

00:07:44.563 --> 00:07:46.966
I need to see the facts.

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:47.966
[ Laughter ]

00:07:47.966 --> 00:07:49.368
-You're seeing them!

00:07:49.368 --> 00:07:52.471
She's literally explaining them
to your face.

00:07:52.471 --> 00:07:53.839
"I need to see the facts."

00:07:53.839 --> 00:07:55.074
"Okay.
Here are the facts."

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:56.609
"Stop interrupting me with facts

00:07:56.609 --> 00:07:58.477
when I'm in the middle
of demanding facts!"

00:07:58.477 --> 00:08:00.779
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:00.779 --> 00:08:04.183
"This is my
fact-demanding time!"

00:08:04.183 --> 00:08:06.752
Republicans are making it
clear as possible

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:08.120
that they
aren't actually interested

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.888
in hearing the truth about
what Brett Kavanaugh did,

00:08:09.888 --> 00:08:11.890
which is infuriating,
since Trump and Republicans

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:13.458
spent the
entire campaign saying,

00:08:13.458 --> 00:08:14.994
"We're a nation of laws."

00:08:14.994 --> 00:08:16.962
Although, in fairness,
honesty is...

00:08:16.962 --> 00:08:18.631
-Not really their thing.

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:20.566
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:08:20.566 --> 00:08:24.203
[ Cheers and applause ]

